  {"instruction": "Send ALGO from one account to another", "output": "goal clerk send -a 1000000 -f XSAT6XG6K6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V -t YSAT6XG6K6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V6V -d /home/algorand/data"},
